{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Milo bumps into Ava's block bridge, and it falls apart.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.48,0.78],[0.84,1.04],[1.13,1.45],[1.51,1.8],[1.87,2.24],[2.26,2.42],[2.48,2.58],[2.67,3.06],[3.11,3.99]]},{"text":"Ava looks upset and crosses her arms.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.43,0.7],[0.76,1.2],[1.25,1.35],[1.42,1.83],[1.9,2.04],[2.13,2.88]]},{"text":"Milo pauses and says, I am sorry I knocked your bridge down.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.49,1.07],[1.14,1.28],[1.36,1.8],[2.18,2.24],[2.32,2.44],[2.53,2.9],[2.96,2.98],[3.06,3.37],[3.39,3.53],[3.6,3.97],[4.03,4.83]]},{"text":"He adds, I can help rebuild it right now.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.3,0.71],[0.78,0.84],[0.93,1.08],[1.14,1.35],[1.42,1.82],[1.88,1.97],[2.03,2.26],[2.32,2.93]]},{"text":"Ava nods slowly and says, Okay, let's make it stronger.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.37,0.66],[0.69,1.16],[1.23,1.35],[1.44,1.96],[2.29,2.74],[2.79,3.04],[3.11,3.32],[3.37,3.46],[3.52,4.5]]},{"text":"They gather blocks and rebuild with two wide supports.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.61],[0.69,1.09],[1.14,1.25],[1.33,1.85],[1.9,2.1],[2.17,2.42],[2.5,2.81],[2.86,3.81]]},{"text":"Milo checks each piece carefully before stepping back.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.46,0.8],[0.87,1.1],[1.17,1.47],[1.53,2.09],[2.16,2.51],[2.55,2.97],[3.05,3.76]]},{"text":"Ava smiles and says, Thank you for helping fix it.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.41,0.92],[0.97,1.11],[1.2,1.67],[1.96,2.26],[2.31,2.4],[2.47,2.63],[2.72,3.09],[3.19,3.5],[3.59,4.18]]},{"text":"Milo learns saying sorry means words plus helpful action.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.51,0.88],[0.94,1.24],[1.33,1.74],[1.81,2.09],[2.16,2.55],[2.62,2.87],[2.95,3.39],[3.47,4.27]]},{"text":"Both friends learn trust grows again through repair and time.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.44,0.84],[0.89,1.21],[1.29,1.66],[1.73,2.07],[2.13,2.42],[2.48,2.79],[2.84,3.29],[3.35,3.5],[3.56,4.37]]}]}